  ['Who makes pneumatic conveying systems?', 'Companies that publish pneumatic conveying system product lines include Coperion, Cyclonaire, Flexicon, Hapman, Kice Industries, Macawber Engineering, Magnum Systems, Nol-Tec Systems, VAC-U-MAX, and Volkmann. They do not all build the same thing. Some offer only vacuum systems or only dilute phase, so check the phase and air source before requesting a quote.'],
  ['Which pneumatic conveying manufacturers offer dense phase systems?', 'Coperion, Cyclonaire, Macawber Engineering, Magnum Systems, and Nol-Tec Systems state that they build dense phase systems. VAC-U-MAX and Volkmann offer dense phase under vacuum. Flexicon and Hapman list dilute phase only.'],
  ['Which manufacturers build only vacuum conveying systems?', 'VAC-U-MAX, Volkmann, and Hapman list vacuum conveying and do not list positive pressure systems. Vacuum suits multiple pickup points and shorter distances. Higher rates and longer distances usually call for a pressure system from a supplier that builds both.'],
