<h1>Best Pneumatic Conveying System Manufacturers by Application</h1>
<p class="usa-intro">The best pneumatic conveying system manufacturer depends on your material and the conveying phase it needs. Macawber and Nol-Tec are the dense phase picks. Volkmann and VAC-U-MAX specialize in vacuum. Coperion and Magnum Systems cover whole process lines. This page compares the top 10 pneumatic conveying manufacturers in North America using each company's published scope.</p>

<figure class="photo"><img src="/img/photos/pneu-flexicon-conveying-lines.webp" width="1000" height="667" alt="Banks of metal conveying pipes with swept bends and bolted couplings run along a brick building beside two rail hopper cars." loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Flexicon pneumatic conveying lines with swept bends and couplings, routed along a building beside rail hopper cars. <span class="photo-credit">Photo: <a href="https://flexicon.com/bulk-handling-equipment-and-systems/pneumatic-conveyors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Flexicon</a></span></figcaption></figure>
<div class="usa-summary-box" role="region" aria-labelledby="criteria-heading">
<div class="usa-summary-box__body">
<h2 class="usa-summary-box__heading" id="criteria-heading">How this list was built</h2>
<div class="usa-summary-box__text">
<ul>
<li>A company is listed if it publishes a product page for pneumatic conveying systems for powders, granules, or pellets, and has a US location.</li>
<li>The list is alphabetical. We do not rank companies 1 to 10, because the best choice changes with the material.</li>
<li>"Best for" labels reflect each company's published scope.</li>
<li>"Not stated" means the company's conveying pages did not mention it on October 5, 2026. It does not mean the company cannot do it.</li>
<li>No company paid to be listed. For how the technology works, see the <a href="/conveyor-types/pneumatic-conveyors/">pneumatic conveying guide</a>.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>

